    "detailed_description": "<strong>It Takes One Year To Beat This Game</strong> is a simple clicker game with just only one objective. Your goal is to reach one billion points. Sounds easy? Yes, but not if each click gives you only one point!<br><br>It takes 30 years to reach the final goal if you click once per second. It takes one year if you click faster. <br><br>Click multiple times to activate income bonus. You can stack these power ups infinitely as long as you keep clicking. <br><br>Unlock several checkpoints to upgrade your click bonuses and get other benefits.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just clicking and nothing more<br></li><li>Crazy unreachable goal if you are noob<br></li><li>Crazy but reachable goal if you are experienced player<br></li><li>Only one achievement<br></li><li>Infinite fun</li></ul><br>And yes, not all your progress is saved when you exit the game. Good luck!<br><br>P.S. Wishlist now and within a month you will be incredibly lucky in life!",
